        // The fuzzer scanning guessPreimage can find one where hash == blockhash(guessBlock) for the set block.
        // We'll check the post-condition: if no revert, balance must have increased by 2 ether.
        // Because the bug never transfers, for any guessPreimage where settle succeeds (correct guess),
        // the reference will show +2 ether, bug will show 0 increase, violating this.

        // Wrapping in try/catch to detect revert.
        bool ok;
        vm.prank(caller);
        try c.settle() { ok = true; } catch { ok = false; }

